OL,4,CNigerian monarch, 92, suspended after  
OL,5,Csexual assault claims                  
OL,6,GOne of Nigeria's best-known monarchs,  
OL,7,Gthe Emir of Daura, has been suspended  
OL,8,Gfrom all official engagements and      
OL,9,Gtravel following allegations of sexual 
OL,10,Gassault by a Polish tourist.           
OL,12,FThe visitor said Umar Farouk Umar, 92, 
OL,13,Fhad grabbed her chest during a tourism 
OL,14,Fencounter and that she felt disgusted  
OL,15,Fby the experience.                     
OL,17,FThe allegation sparked widespread      
OL,18,Fdiscussion across social media         
OL,19,Fplatforms, with many calling for the   
OL,20,Fsuspension of the emir and an          
OL,21,Finvestigation - calls the Katsina      
OL,22,Fstate government has now heeded.       
